p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">North Carolina barley, milled the same morning it hits the tun.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4 border-l-2 border-neutral-700 pl-6\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-4 border-l-2 border-neutral-700 pl-6\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"flame\",\"className\":\"w-7 h-7 text-indigo-400 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">02</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h3\",\"className\":\"text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-white m-0\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-white m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Boil</h3><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Whole-cone hops, thrown by hand and by feel. Timers are suggestions.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4 border-l-2 border-neutral-700 pl-6\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-4 border-l-2 border-neutral-700 pl-6\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"thermometer\",\"className\":\"w-7 h-7 text-indigo-400 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">03</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h3\",\"className\":\"text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-white m-0\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-white m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Ferment</h3><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Two weeks minimum in steel. Patience is the cheapest ingredient we use.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4 border-l-2 border-neutral-700 pl-6\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-4 border-l-2 border-neutral-700 pl-6\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"beer\",\"className\":\"w-7 h-7 text-indigo-400 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">04</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h3\",\"className\":\"text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-white m-0\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-white m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Pour</h3><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Fifty feet from kettle to faucet. Freshness is not a marketing word here.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></section><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"bg-white px-6 py-24\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box alignfull bg-white px-6 py-24\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-center\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-center\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/image {\"className\":\"w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover border-2 border-neutral-900 m-0\"} --><img class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-image w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover border-2 border-neutral-900 m-0\" src=\"https://cdn.stocksnap.io/img-thumbs/960w/B344F5C660.jpg\" alt=\"The taproom bar at night\"/><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/image --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-6\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-6\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-xs font-black tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-indigo-600 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-xs font-black tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-indigo-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">The taproom</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h2\",\"className\":\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-900 m-0\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-900 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Drink it where they make it.</h2><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Long tables, loud nights, food trucks out front Thursday through Sunday. Kids and dogs welcome until eight, growlers filled until close.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/link {\"className\":\"inline-block border-2 border-neutral-900 text-neutral-900 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] px-8 py-4 rounded-none hover:bg-neutral-900 hover:text-white\"} --><a class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-link inline-block border-2 border-neutral-900 text-neutral-900 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] px-8 py-4 rounded-none hover:bg-neutral-900 hover:text-white\" href=\"#hours\">Hours &amp; directions</a><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/link --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></section><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"bg-neutral-100 px-6 py-24\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box alignfull bg-neutral-100 px-6 py-24\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex gap-1\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex gap-1\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"star\",\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-400 fill-current m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"star\",\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-400 fill-current m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"star\",\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-400 fill-current m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"star\",\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-400 fill-current m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"star\",\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-400 fill-current m-0\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight leading-snug text-neutral-900 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight leading-snug text-neutral-900 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">&#8220;Best IPA in the Blue Ridge, and the room smells like a bakery for beer.&#8221;</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-xs font-black tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-neutral-500 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-xs font-black tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-neutral-500 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Mountain Ale Trail &#8212; 2026 guide</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></section><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-24\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box alignfull bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-24\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-8 text-center\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-8 text-center\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h2\",\"className\":\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-white m-0\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-white m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Fresh batch drops every Friday.</h2><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-indigo-100 max-w-md m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-indigo-100 max-w-md m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Join the mailing list and know what is pouring before the chalkboard does.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/link {\"className\":\"inline-block bg-white text-neutral-900 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] px-8 py-4 rounded-none hover:bg-neutral-100\"} --><a class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-link inline-block bg-white text-neutral-900 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] px-8 py-4 rounded-none hover:bg-neutral-100\" href=\"#signup\">Get the tap alert</a><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/link --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></section><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box -->\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:1:{i:0;s:12:\"style:poster\";}s:8:\"title_de\";s:18:\"Brewery - Homepage\";}i:17;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:15:\"brewery-taproom\";s:7:\"minimum\";