tomic-wind-text max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-200 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Gear questions, trip planning, a strap that gave up &#8212; the people answering are the same people who test the kit.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></section><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"bg-white px-6 py-24\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box alignfull bg-white px-6 py-24\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-start gap-8\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col items-start gap-8\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-3\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Shop &#183; workshop &#183; trip desk</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h2\",\"className\":\"text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">The basecamp</h2><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-5\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-5\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex items-center gap-3\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"map-pin\",\"className\":\"size-5 text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"text-base text-neutral-700 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-base text-neutral-700 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Strandgaten 14, 5013 Bergen, Norway</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex items-center gap-3\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"phone\",\"className\":\"size-5 text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"text-base text-neutral-700 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-base text-neutral-700 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">+47 55 21 40 89</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex items-center gap-3\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"mail\",\"className\":\"size-5 text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"text-base text-neutral-700 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-base text-neutral-700 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">basecamp@northtrail.no</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex items-center gap-3\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"clock\",\"className\":\"size-5 text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"text-base text-neutral-700 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-base text-neutral-700 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Mon&#8211;Fri 9:00&#8211;18:00 &#183; Sat 10:00&#8211;16:00</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/link {\"className\":\"inline-block bg-indigo-600 px-8 py-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white transition hover:bg-indigo-500\"} --><a class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-link inline-block bg-indigo-600 px-8 py-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white transition hover:bg-indigo-500\" href=\"#directions\">Get directions</a><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/link --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/image {\"className\":\"aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover m-0\"} --><img class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-image aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover m-0\" src=\"https://cdn.stocksnap.io/img-thumbs/960w/LIAQ9N16WK.jpg\" alt=\"Campfire at night\"/><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/image --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></section><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"border-t-2 border-neutral-950 bg-white px-6 py-20\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box alignfull border-t-2 border-neutral-950 bg-white px-6 py-20\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 md:grid-cols-3\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 md:grid-cols-3\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-indigo-500 pl-6\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-indigo-500 pl-6\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"backpack\",\"className\":\"size-7 text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h3\",\"className\":\"text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Gear advice</h3><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Not sure which pack fits your spine or your trip? Walk in or call &#8212; a fitting takes twenty minutes and costs nothing.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-indigo-500 pl-6\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-indigo-500 pl-6\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"mountain\",\"className\":\"size-7 text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h3\",\"className\":\"text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Trip planning calls</h3><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Book a free 30-minute call with a guide before any expedition. We will talk routes, weather windows and what to leave at home.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-indigo-500 pl-6\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-indigo-500 pl-6\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"wrench\",\"className\":\"size-7 text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h3\",\"className\":\"text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Repairs and returns</h3><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Ship broken gear to the Bergen workshop or drop it at the counter. Most repairs go back out within ten days &#8212; labour free, for life.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></section><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"bg-neutral-950 px-6 py-24\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box alignfull bg-neutral-950 px-6 py-24\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 md:grid-cols-2\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 md:grid-cols-2\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-start gap-4\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col items-start gap-4\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Write to the trip desk</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h2\",\"className\":\"text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-white m-0\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-white m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Send a message</h2><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"max-w-md leading-relaxed text-neutral-300 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text max-w-md leading-relaxed text-neutral-300 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Tell us where you are headed and what you are carrying. A guide reads every message and answers within one working day.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col\"><!-- wp:themeisle-blocks/form {\"submitLabel\":\"Send to basecamp\",\"id\":\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-56029a8a\",\"optionName\":\"4b6b80b329b848e1a1ae107eb0621c0574210faf_56029a8a\",\"labelColor\":\"#ffffff\",\"submitBackgroundColor\":\"#4f46e5\",\"submitBackgroundColorHover\":\"#4338ca\",\"submitColor\":\"#ffffff\",\"inputBackgroundColor\":\"#ffffff\"} --><div id=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-56029a8a\" class=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form\" data-option-name=\"4b6b80b329b848e1a1ae107eb0621c0574210faf_56029a8a\"><form class=\"otter-form__container\"><!-- wp:themeisle-blocks/form-input {\"id\":\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-input-26b9084d\",\"label\":\"Name\",\"isRequired\":true,\"labelColor\":\"#ffffff\"} --><div id=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-input-26b9084d\" class=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-input\"><label for=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-input-26b9084d-input\" class=\"otter-form-input-label\"><span class=\"otter-form-input-label__label\">Name</span><span class=\"required\">*</span></label><input type=\"text\" id=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-input-26b9084d-input\" required class=\"otter-form-input\"/></div><!-- /wp:themeisle-blocks/form-input --><!-- wp:themeisle-blocks/form-input {\"id\":\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-input-f1f28a13\",\"type\":\"email\",\"label\":\"Email\",\"isRequired\":true,\"labelColor\":\"#ffffff\"} --><div id=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-input-f1f28a13\" class=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-input\"><label for=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-input-f1f28a13-input\" class=\"otter-form-input-label\"><span class=\"otter-form-input-label__label\">Email</span><span class=\"required\">*</span></label><input type=\"email\" id=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-input-f1f28a13-input\" required class=\"otter-form-input\"/></div><!-- /wp:themeisle-blocks/form-input --><!-- wp:themeisle-blocks/form-textarea {\"id\":\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-textarea-ca45e8a6\",\"label\":\"What trip are you planning?\"} --><div id=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-textarea-ca45e8a6\" class=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-textarea\"><label for=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-textarea-ca45e8a6-input\" class=\"otter-form-textarea-label\"><span class=\"otter-form-textarea-label__label\">What trip are you planning?</span></label><textarea id=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-textarea-ca45e8a6-input\" rows=\"10\" class=\"otter-form-textarea-input\"></textarea></div><!-- /wp:themeisle-blocks/form-textarea --><!-- wp:themeisle-blocks/form-nonce {\"formId\":\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-form-56029a8a\"} /--><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><button class=\"wp-block-button__link\" type=\"submit\">Send to basecamp</button></div></form></div><!-- /wp:themeisle-blocks/form --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></section><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-24\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box alignfull bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-24\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"mx-auto flex max-w-4xl flex-col items-center gap-7 text-center\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box mx-auto flex max-w-4xl flex-col items-center gap-7 text-center\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h2\",\"className\":\"text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-white md:text-6xl m-0\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-white md:text-6xl m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Out there? So are we.</h2><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"max-w-md leading-relaxed text-indigo-100 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text max-w-md leading-relaxed text-indigo-100 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Email gets answered within a day. The phone gets answered unless we are above the treeline.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/link {\"className\":\"inline-block bg-white px-10 py-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-700 transition hover:bg-indigo-50\"} --><a class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-link inline-block bg-white px-10 py-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-700 transition hover:bg-indigo-50\" href=\"mailto:basecamp@northtrail.no\">Email the basecamp</a><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/link --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></section><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box -->\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:1:{i:0;s:12:\"style:poster\";}s:8:\"title_de\";s:17:\"Outdoor - Contact\";}i:82;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:19:\"outdoor-expeditions\";s:7:\"minimum\";s:3:\"6.0\";s:5:\"title\";s:21:\"Outdoor - Expeditions\";s:10:\"categories\";a:3:{i:0;s:12:\"otter-blocks\";i:1;s:5:\"pages\";i:2;s:12:\"outdoor-pack\";}s:11:\"description\";s:169:\"Full guided expeditions page for an outdoor adventure and hiking company, with photo hero, three-column trip cards, included-perks list, guide team grid and booking CTA.\";s:7:\"content\";s:19080:\"<!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-neutral-950 px-6 py-28 md:py-36\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box alignfull relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-neutral-950 px-6 py-28 md:py-36\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/image {\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 h-full w-full object-cover m-0\"} --><img class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-image absolute inset-0 -z-10 h-full w-full object-cover m-0\" src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/7668/18019552602_fec72db133_b.jpg\" alt=\"Group hiking across grassland\"/><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/image --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-neutral-950/60\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-neutral-950/60\"></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-start gap-7\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-start gap-7\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-300 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-300 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Fourteen trips a year &#183; max 8 people</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h1\",\"className\":\"text-6xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight text-white md:text-8xl m-0\"} --><h1 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-6xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight text-white md:text-8xl m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Expeditions.</h1><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-200 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-200 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Guided trips run by the same people who test the gear. Small groups, real weather, food worth carrying.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></section><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"bg-white px-6 py-20\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box alignfull bg-white px-6 py-20\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 md:grid-cols-3\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 md:grid-cols-3\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-4\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/image {\"className\":\"h-72 w-full object-cover m-0\"} --><img class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-image h-72 w-full object-cover m-0\" src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/538/18435466413_a1def26dea_b.jpg\" alt=\"Hiker on a ridge at sunrise\"/><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/image --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3 border-t-2 border-neutral-950 pt-4\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-3 border-t-2 border-neutral-950 pt-4\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">6 days &#183; hard &#183; $1,450</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h3\",\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Jotunheimen Traverse</h3><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Hut to hut across the roof of Norway, with two summits over 2,300 m if the window opens.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex items-center gap-2\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/link {\"className\":\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-950 underline decoration-indigo-600 decoration-2 underline-offset-4\"} --><a class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-link text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-950 underline decoration-indigo-600 decoration-2 underline-offset-4\" href=\"#book\">Trip details</a><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/link --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"arrow-right\",\"className\":\"size-4 text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-4\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/image {\"className\":\"h-72 w-full object-cover m-0\"} --><img class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-image h-72 w-full object-cover m-0\" src=\"https://cdn.stocksnap.io/img-thumbs/960w/LIAQ9N16WK.jpg\" alt=\"Campfire at night\"/><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/image --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3 border-t-2 border-neutral-950 pt-4\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-3 border-t-2 border-neutral-950 pt-4\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">4 days &#183; moderate &#183; $890</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h3\",\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Fjord Basecamp</h3><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">One camp, three day-routes, zero pack-hauling. The introduction we recommend first.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex items-center gap-2\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/link {\"className\":\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-950 underline decoration-indigo-600 decoration-2 underline-offset-4\"} --><a class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-link text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-950 underline decoration-indigo-600 decoration-2 underline-offset-4\" href=\"#book\">Trip details</a><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/link --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"arrow-right\",\"className\":\"size-4 text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-4\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/image {\"className\":\"h-72 w-full object-cover m-0\"} --><img class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-image h-72 w-full object-cover m-0\" src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/1905/45517854902_65465a58e2_b.jpg\" alt=\"Grass silhouettes at dawn\"/><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/image --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3 border-t-2 border-neutral-950 pt-4\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-3 border-t-2 border-neutral-950 pt-4\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">9 days &#183; expedition &#183; $2,900</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h3\",\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-950 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Hardanger Winter Crossing</h3><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">The plateau in February. Pulks, whiteouts, and the best northern lights you will ever earn.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex items-center gap-2\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/link {\"className\":\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-950 underline decoration-indigo-600 decoration-2 underline-offset-4\"} --><a class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-link text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-950 underline decoration-indigo-600 decoration-2 underline-offset-4\" href=\"#book\">Trip details</a><!-- /wp:atomic-w