m-0\"} --><h1 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-6xl md:text-8xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.9] text-white m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">The artists.</h1><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"className\":\"text-lg text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-lg text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Six residents, six styles, one standard. Every artist here apprenticed for years before touching skin &#8212; pick the hand that fits your idea.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></section><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"bg-neutral-950 px-6 pb-24\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box alignfull bg-neutral-950 px-6 pb-24\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-5\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-5\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"overflow-hidden border-4 border-double border-neutral-700 aspect-[4/5]\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box overflow-hidden border-4 border-double border-neutral-700 aspect-[4/5]\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/image {\"className\":\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 m-0\"} --><img class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-image w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 m-0\" src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/8677/30162262342_37fb95f36e_b.jpg\" alt=\"Viktor Hale\"/><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/image --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-2\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-2\"><!-- wp:atomic-w