 wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-teal-300 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm font-semibold text-teal-300 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Safety Lead</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></section><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box -->\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:1:{i:0;s:11:\"style:glass\";}s:8:\"title_de\";s:20:\"Cinematic Glass Team\";}i:113;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:14:\"team-list-rows\";s:7:\"minimum\";s:3:\"6.0\";s:5:\"title\";s:14:\"Team List Rows\";s:10:\"categories\";a:2:{i:0;s:12:\"otter-blocks\";i:1;s:4:\"team\";}s:11:\"description\";s:158:\"Minimal team list with stacked bordered rows showing avatar, name, role, bio and social icons, full-width about-us staff layout for company and startup teams.\";s:7:\"content\";s:10573:\"<!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"bg-white px-6 py-24\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box alignfull bg-white px-6 py-24\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"mb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 items-start\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box mb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 items-start\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Who we are</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h2\",\"className\":\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 md:text-5xl m-0\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 md:text-5xl m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">A small team, a big appetite</h2><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"p\",\"className\":\"max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">No layers, no silos &#8212; just the people who actually build and run the thing you use every day.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-start gap-5 border-t border-neutral-200 py-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-8\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col items-start gap-5 border-t border-neutral-200 py-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-8\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/image {\"url\":\"https://picsum.photos/seed/trow1/160/160\",\"alt\":\"Sofia Marchetti\",\"className\":\"size-20 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover m-0\"} --><img class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-image size-20 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover m-0\" src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/trow1/160/160\" alt=\"Sofia Marchetti\"/><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/image --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-1\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-1\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h3\",\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 m-0\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Sofia Marchetti</h3><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-indigo-600 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-indigo-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Chief Executive</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"p\",\"className\":\"max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 sm:ml-auto m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 sm:ml-auto m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Twenty years scaling product teams from garage to global. Obsessed with clarity.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex items-center gap-3\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"twitter\",\"className\":\"size-5 text-neutral-400 transition hover:text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"linkedin\",\"className\":\"size-5 text-neutral-400 transition hover:text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"github\",\"className\":\"size-5 text-neutral-400 transition hover:text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-start gap-5 border-t border-neutral-200 py-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-8\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col items-start gap-5 border-t border-neutral-200 py-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-8\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/image {\"url\":\"https://picsum.photos/seed/trow2/160/160\",\"alt\":\"Marcus Bell\",\"className\":\"size-20 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover m-0\"} --><img class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-image size-20 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover m-0\" src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/trow2/160/160\" alt=\"Marcus Bell\"/><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/image --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-1\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-1\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h3\",\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 m-0\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Marcus Bell</h3><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-indigo-600 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-indigo-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Chief Technology Officer</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"p\",\"className\":\"max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 sm:ml-auto m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 sm:ml-auto m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Built the platform from the first commit. Believes the best code is the code you delete.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex items-center gap-3\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"twitter\",\"className\":\"size-5 text-neutral-400 transition hover:text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"linkedin\",\"className\":\"size-5 text-neutral-400 transition hover:text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"github\",\"className\":\"size-5 text-neutral-400 transition hover:text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-start gap-5 border-t border-neutral-200 py-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-8\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col items-start gap-5 border-t border-neutral-200 py-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-8\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/image {\"url\":\"https://picsum.photos/seed/trow3/160/160\",\"alt\":\"Yuki Tanaka\",\"className\":\"size-20 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover m-0\"} --><img class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-image size-20 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover m-0\" src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/trow3/160/160\" alt=\"Yuki Tanaka\"/><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/image --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-1\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col gap-1\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"h3\",\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 m-0\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Yuki Tanaka</h3><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"span\",\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-indigo-600 m-0\"} --><span class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-indigo-600 m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Head of Operations</span><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/text {\"tagName\":\"p\",\"className\":\"max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 sm:ml-auto m-0\"} --><p class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-text max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 sm:ml-auto m-0\" data-rich-text=\"\">Keeps the trains running and the team smiling. Former competitive chess player.</p><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/text --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex items-center gap-3\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"twitter\",\"className\":\"size-5 text-neutral-400 transition hover:text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"linkedin\",\"className\":\"size-5 text-neutral-400 transition hover:text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--><!-- wp:atomic-wind/icon {\"icon\":\"github\",\"className\":\"size-5 text-neutral-400 transition hover:text-indigo-600 m-0\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --></div><!-- /wp:atomic-wind/box --><!-- wp:atomic-wind/box {\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-start gap-5 border-t border-neutral-200 py-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-8\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-atomic-wind-box flex flex-col items-start gap-5 border-t border-neutral-200 py-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-8\"><!-- wp:atomic-wind/image {\"url\":\"https://picsum.photos/seed/trow4/160/160\",\"alt\":\"Amara Diallo\",\"className\":\"size-20 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover m-0\"} --><img class=\"wp